    -- the accepted Dramatic flat-card path already owns. Test5 borrowed the
    -- main scene's live player texture, so Dynamic BACK leaked into PiP and
    -- Gen1 could legitimately expose no player texture while its host kept the
    -- ordinary back card pinned. The existing producer requests FRONT for this
    -- one private capture, mirrors it only from SECONDARY VIEW LEFT/RIGHT, and
    -- restores provider battle state immediately. This is representation
