end)()



-- Official Dramatic Shape 1.6.1 + Stadium2 Importer Gen1 MAP bridge --------
--
-- The existing Dramatic hosted-provider bridge below targets the later 1.9
-- contract. Official 1.6.1 predates that contract, but it still exposes its
-- public OverworldBattle session plus VoxelScene renderer. For LIVE VOXEL
-- ARENA, render that exact staged MAP world into Importer's environment phase.
-- Official 1.6.1 is a Gen1 target; no Gen2 compatibility claim is made here.
-- Importer remains actor/HUD host; BC remains director.
--
-- Test28 preserves Test27's accepted world bridge and tests one performance
-- hypothesis: its full-frame, optionally supersampled hosted world is the
-- remaining fill-rate cliff on Android. The hosted environment is therefore
-- rendered into a bounded 960x540-class internal target and scaled once into
-- Importer's full target. This pass deliberately does not inherit Dramatic AA;
-- Importer actors/HUD remain full-resolution and all camera geometry is unchanged.
